      "summaries": {
        "en": "Claude Code is a terminal-based AI coding assistant that helps developers automate routine tasks and understand complex codebases through natural language commands. It works by analyzing your entire code repository context to provide intelligent suggestions and execute commands directly in your development environment. You can use it to generate boilerplate code, debug existing functions, or manage Git workflows—simply type your request in plain English and let it handle the implementation details.",
        "zh": "Claude Code 是一款基于终端的AI编程助手，它通过自然语言命令帮助开发者自动化日常任务并理解复杂代码库。其核心在于能够分析整个代码仓库的上下文，直接在开发环境中提供智能建议并执行命令。你可以用它生成样板代码、调试现有函数或管理Git工作流——只需用简单英语描述需求，它就能处理具体的实现细节，让编程工作更高效直观。",
        "es": "Claude Code is a terminal-based AI coding assistant that helps developers automate routine tasks and understand complex codebases through natural language commands. It works by analyzing your entire code repository context to provide intelligent suggestions and execute commands directly in your development environment. You can use it to generate boilerplate code, debug existing functions, or manage Git workflows—simply type your request in plain English and let it handle the implementation details.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "claude-code gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "Claude Code is a terminal-based AI coding assistant that helps developers automate routine tasks and understand complex codebases through natural language commands. It works by analyzing your entire code repository context to provide intelligent suggestions and execute commands directly in your development environment. You can use it to generate boilerplate code, debug existing functions, or manage Git workflows—simply type your request in plain English and let it handle the implementation details.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
